			"text": "Why Not\n\n 1. TRIE : good for prefix search will take lot of space and [just to tell username exist or not]                    \n 2. HASHMAP/CACHE/REDIS : need lot os space lot of memory, lot of money\n 3. DB : O(n) lookup very slow - after indexing also it will still be slow",
			"rawText": "Why Not\n\n 1. TRIE : good for prefix search will take lot of space and [just to tell username exist or not]                    \n 2. HASHMAP/CACHE/REDIS : need lot os space lot of memory, lot of money\n 3. DB : O(n) lookup very slow - after indexing also it will still be slow",
